# Connectionist Modeling as the Basis for Multimedia Clinical Patient Simulations with Diagnostic Capabilities.

**Authors:** Bergeron, Bryan P., And Others

## Abstract
Presents a connectionist approach to modeling that relies on neural networks to control conventional simulations of multimedia clinical patient simulations. These neural networks simplify the medical expert's task of validating and maintaining patient simulations with diagnostic capabilities and serves as the basis of clinical decision support tools that complement patient simulations. (Author/JMV)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ518446

